msgstr "Stabiele PPA (Bevat alleen officiële releases)"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:133
msgid "Daily PPA (Highly experimental and unstable, for testers)"
msgstr "Dagelijkse PPA (Zeer experimenteel en onstabiel, voor testers)"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:142
msgid "Chrome OS (Chromebook)"
msgstr "Chrome OS (Chromebook)"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:144
msgid ""
"Chrome OS supports Linux apps, but this feature is off by default. You can "
"turn it on in *Settings*. Once Linux is enabled, you can install and run "
"SmartEdit Linux AppImages on any *x86-based* Chromebook. The command below "
"will download our AppImage and configure your system to run SmartEdit "
"successfully."
msgstr ""
"Chrome OS ondersteunt Linux-apps, maar deze functie is standaard "
"uitgeschakeld. U kunt deze inschakelen in *Instellingen*. Zodra Linux is "
"ingeschakeld, kunt u SmartEdit Linux AppImages installeren en uitvoeren op "
"elke *x86-gebaseerde* Chromebook. De onderstaande opdracht downloadt onze "
"AppImage en configureert uw systeem om SmartEdit succesvol uit te voeren."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:149
msgid "Navigate to *chrome://os-settings/crostini* (Copy/Paste)"
msgstr "Navigeer naar *chrome://os-settings/crostini* (Kopiëren/Plakken)"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:150
msgid "Under \"Linux (Beta)\" select \"Turn On\". Default values are fine."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer onder \"Linux (Beta)\" de optie \"Inschakelen\". Standaardwaarden "
"zijn prima."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:152
msgid ""
"When the Terminal appears (i.e. black window), Copy/Paste the following "
"command:"
msgstr ""
"Wanneer de Terminal verschijnt (bijv. zwart venster), kopieer/plak dan de "
"volgende opdracht:"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:152
msgid ""
"``bash <(wget -O - http://smartedit.org/files/chromeos/install-stable.sh)``"
msgstr ""
"``bash <(wget -O - http://smartedit.org/files/chromeos/install-stable.sh)``"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:155
msgid "Previous Versions"
msgstr "Vorige Versies"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:157
msgid ""
"To download old versions of SmartEdit Video Editor, you can visit https://"
"github.com/SmartEdit/smartedit-qt/tags. Click on the version number you need, "
"and scroll to the bottom, under the release notes. You will find download "
"links for each operating system. Download the appropriate version for your "
"computer, and follow the installation instructions above."
msgstr ""
"Om oude versies van SmartEdit Video Editor te downloaden, kunt u https://"
"github.com/SmartEdit/smartedit-qt/tags bezoeken. Klik op het versienummer dat "
"u nodig hebt en scrol naar beneden, onder de release-opmerkingen. U vindt "
"downloadlinks voor elk besturingssysteem. Download de juiste versie voor uw "
"computer en volg de installatie-instructies hierboven."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:162
msgid ""
"NOTE: Projects (\\*.osp) made with newer versions of SmartEdit Video Editor "
"might not support older versions."
msgstr ""
"OPMERKING: Projecten (\\*.osp) gemaakt met nieuwere versies van SmartEdit "
"Video Editor worden mogelijk niet ondersteund door oudere versies."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:165
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Verwijderen"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../installation.rst:167
msgid ""
"To fully uninstall SmartEdit from your system, you must **manually delete** "
"the ``.smartedit_qt`` folder: ``~/.smartedit_qt/`` or ``C:\\Users\\USERNAME\\."
"smartedit_qt\\``, which contains all settings and files used by SmartEdit. Be "
"sure to **backup** any recovery files of your existing projects first (\\*."
"osp files). Please see :ref:`preferences_reset_ref` for instructions on "
"clearing the previous ``smartedit.settings`` file (for a clean install with "
"**default preferences**)."
msgstr ""
"Om SmartEdit volledig van uw systeem te verwijderen, moet u de map ``."
"smartedit_qt`` **handmatig verwijderen**: ``~/.smartedit_qt/`` of ``C:"
"\\Users\\USERNAME\\.smartedit_qt\\``, die alle instellingen en bestanden "
"bevat die door SmartEdit worden gebruikt. Zorg ervoor dat u eerst een **back-"
"up** maakt van eventuele herstelbestanden van uw bestaande projecten (\\*."
"osp-bestanden). Zie :ref:`preferences_reset_ref` voor instructies over het "
"wissen van het vorige ``smartedit.settings``-bestand (voor een schone "
"installatie met **standaardvoorkeuren**)."

